---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
---
<Base
  title="Lab"
  description="Two quick interactive games on computer architecture and backend performance: race a cache replacement policy and prefetcher against Bélády's optimal, then scale a backend under rising traffic without breaking the p99 SLO."
>
  <header class="page-head" data-mark="lab">
    <h1>Lab</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Two small games, each a minute or so, about the systems ideas I work with:
      caches and prefetchers, and what happens to latency as a backend fills up.
    </p>
  </header>

  <section class="card game" aria-labelledby="cache-h">
    <h2 id="cache-h">Beat the cache oracle</h2>
    <p class="teaches">
      <b>What this teaches:</b> replacement policy only matters when data gets
      reused, and a good prefetcher can beat even the optimal replacement policy.
    </p>
    <p class="aside">
      This is the problem my research on <a href="/#work">DAP (Dead-block Aware Prefetching)</a>
      tackles: predict which cached blocks will never be used again and put
      prefetches there instead of over live data. That cut GPU cache misses by 32%.
    </p>
    <div class="stage" data-game="cache">
      <p class="fallback">
        A 4-set, 2-way cache with 64-byte lines receives a stream of memory
        addresses. You choose a replacement policy (LRU, FIFO or random) and a
        prefetcher (none, next-line or stride), then step through one of three
        access patterns: sequential, strided and a loop with reuse. Hits and
        misses are shown line by line with a live hit-rate meter, and your final
        score is compared against Bélády's optimal replacement policy. Enable
        JavaScript to play.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="card game" aria-labelledby="scale-h">
    <h2 id="scale-h">Scale the backend</h2>
    <p class="teaches">
      <b>What this teaches:</b> queueing delay grows like 1/(1−ρ), so latency is flat
      until a tier nears full utilisation and then shoots up. Find the bottleneck
      and fix it before that happens.
    </p>
    <div class="stage" data-game="scale">
      <p class="fallback">
        Traffic to a web backend ramps up over 60 seconds, with a spike near the
        end. Served requests earn credits, which you spend on app replicas, a
        Redis cache (a longer TTL gives more hits but staler reads), an async
        queue, database read replicas and a rate limiter. Each tier is modelled as
        a queue: latency grows as 1/(1−ρ) with utilisation ρ, and requests drop
        once ρ reaches 1. The goal is to keep p99 latency under a 300 ms SLO with
        almost no errors; a live sparkline tracks latency and throughput, and a
        summary grades your run. Enable JavaScript to play.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<script>
  const games = {
    cache: () => import('../scripts/lab/cache.js'),
    scale: () => import('../scripts/lab/scale.js'),
  }
  const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
    for (const e of entries) {
      if (!e.isIntersecting) continue
      io.unobserve(e.target)
      const el = e.target as HTMLElement
      games[el.dataset.game as keyof typeof games]().then((m) => m.default(el))
    }
  }, { rootMargin: '200px 0px' })
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-game]').forEach((el) => io.observe(el))
</script>

<style>
  .game { padding: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  @media (min-width: 640px) { .game { padding: 1.75rem 2rem; } }
  .game h2 { margin: 0 0 0.5rem; font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3.5vw, 1.8rem); }
  .teaches { color: var(--muted); max-width: 44rem; }
  .teaches b { color: var(--ink); }
  .aside { font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--muted); max-width: 44rem; padding-left: 0.8rem; border-left: 3px solid var(--accent); }
  .fallback { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); }
  .stage { margin-top: 1.25rem; min-height: 8rem; }

  /* Shared bits for the generated game UI */
  .stage :global(.opts) { border: 0; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 0.75rem; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.4rem; align-items: center; }
  .stage :global(.opts legend) { float: left; width: 100%; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 0.35rem; padding: 0; }
  .stage :global(.opts label) { position: relative; }
  .stage :global(.opts input) { position: absolute; opacity: 0; inset: 0; margin: 0; cursor: pointer; }
  .stage :global(.opts span) {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.8rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--surface);
    color: var(--muted);
    transition: color 0.15s, border-color 0.15s, background 0.15s;
  }
  .stage :global(.opts label:hover span) { color: var(--ink); border-color: var(--muted); }
  .stage :global(.opts input:checked + span) { background: var(--ink); border-color: var(--ink); color: var(--bg); }
  .stage :global(.opts input:focus-visible + span) { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 2px; }
  .stage :global(.opts:disabled) { opacity: 0.5; }

  .stage :global(.ctrl) { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; }
  .stage :global(.btn) { font: inherit; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; }
  .stage :global(.btn:disabled) { opacity: 0.5; cursor: default; transform: none; }
  .stage :global(.log) { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--muted); min-height: 2.6em; margin: 0.9rem 0; }

  .stage :global(.meter) { height: 0.6rem; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--surface-2); overflow: hidden; }
  .stage :global(.meter i) { display: block; height: 100%; width: 0; background: var(--easy); border-radius: inherit; transition: width 0.3s ease, background 0.3s; }
  .stage :global(.meter i[data-tone='warn']) { background: var(--medium); }
  .stage :global(.meter i[data-tone='bad']) { background: var(--hard); }

  .stage :global(.mini) { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem 1.5rem; margin: 0.75rem 0 0; }
  .stage :global(.mini dt) { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--muted); }
  .stage :global(.mini dd) { margin: 0; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }

  .stage :global(.result) { margin-top: 1.25rem; padding: 1rem 1.1rem; border-radius: 10px; background: var(--accent-soft); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, transparent); }
  .stage :global(.result p:last-child) { margin-bottom: 0; }

  /* Cache game */
  .stage :global(.takeaway) { font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0.25rem 0 1rem; padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem; border-radius: 8px; background: var(--surface-2); }
  .stage :global(.stream-wrap) { overflow-x: auto; margin-bottom: 1rem; padding: 0.25rem 0; scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  .stage :global(.stream) { display: flex; gap: 0.3rem; list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0 0 0.3rem; width: max-content; }
  .stage :global(.stream li) {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.45rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .stage :global(.stream li.now) { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--ink); box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--accent-soft); }
  .stage :global(.stream li.hit) { color: var(--easy); border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--easy) 45%, transparent); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--easy) 10%, transparent); }
  .stage :global(.stream li.miss) { color: var(--hard); border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--hard) 45%, transparent); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--hard) 10%, transparent); }

  .stage :global(.cache-row) { display: grid; gap: 1.25rem; align-items: start; }
  @media (min-width: 640px) { .stage :global(.cache-row) { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 20rem) 1fr; } }
  .stage :global(.cache) { border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 0.3rem; width: 100%; margin: -0.3rem; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .stage :global(.cache th) { font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--muted); text-align: center; }
  .stage :global(.cache td) { text-align: center; padding: 0.55rem 0.3rem; border-radius: 8px; background: var(--surface-2); border: 1px solid var(--line); position: relative; }
  .stage :global(.cache td.empty) { color: var(--muted); background: transparent; border-style: dashed; }
  .stage :global(.cache td small) { position: absolute; top: 0.1rem; right: 0.3rem; font-size: 0.6rem; color: var(--accent); }
  .stage :global(.cache td.pf) { border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 50%, transparent); }
  .stage :global(.cache td.hit) { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--easy) 20%, var(--surface)); border-color: var(--easy); }
  .stage :global(.cache td.miss) { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--hard) 18%, var(--surface)); border-color: var(--hard); }
  .stage :global(.cache td.fetched) { background: var(--accent-soft); border-color: var(--accent); }
  .stage :global(.meter-label) { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; margin-bottom: 0.35rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .stage :global(.meter-label b) { font-size: 1.6rem; letter-spacing: -0.03em; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .stage :global(.meter-box .meter) { height: 0.85rem; }

  /* Backend game */
  .stage :global(.tiles) { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(7.5rem, 1fr)); gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .stage :global(.tiles > div) { padding: 0.55rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 10px; background: var(--surface-2); min-width: 0; }
  .stage :global(.tiles span) { display: block; font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--muted); }
  .stage :global(.tiles b) { font-size: 1.15rem; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .stage :global(.tiles b[data-tone='warn']) { color: var(--medium); }
  .stage :global(.tiles b[data-tone='bad']) { color: var(--hard); }
  .stage :global(.spark) { margin: 0 0 1rem; }
  .stage :global(.spark canvas) { display: block; width: 100%; height: 120px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--bg); }
  .stage :global(.spark figcaption) { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 0.4rem; }
  .stage :global(.key::before) { content: ''; display: inline-block; width: 0.9rem; height: 3px; margin-right: 0.35rem; vertical-align: middle; border-radius: 2px; }
  .stage :global(.k-lat::before) { background: var(--accent); }
  .stage :global(.k-thr::before) { background: var(--easy); }
  .stage :global(.k-slo::before) { background: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, var(--hard) 0 4px, transparent 4px 7px); }
  .stage :global(.util) { display: grid; gap: 0.6rem 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 0.9rem; }
  @media (min-width: 640px) { .stage :global(.util) { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
  .stage :global(.util span) { display: block; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; color: var(--muted); }
  .stage :global(.util span b) { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }
  .stage :global(.shop) { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(8.5rem, 1fr)); gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .stage :global(.buy) {
    font: inherit;
    text-align: left;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.1rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--surface);
    color: var(--ink);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: border-color 0.15s, background 0.15s;
  }
  .stage :global(.buy:hover:not(:disabled)) { border-color: var(--accent); background: var(--accent-soft); }
  .stage :global(.buy:disabled) { opacity: 0.5; cursor: default; }
  .stage :global(.buy b) { font-size: 0.92rem; }
  .stage :global(.buy span) { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.3; }
  .stage :global(.buy em) { font-style: normal; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--accent); margin-top: 0.2rem; }
  .stage :global(.buy em i) { font-style: normal; color: var(--muted); }
  .stage :global(.grade) { font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
  .stage :global(.grade b) { font-size: 2rem; color: var(--accent); margin-left: 0.3rem; }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .stage :global(.cache td.hit),
    .stage :global(.cache td.miss),
    .stage :global(.cache td.fetched) { animation: pop 0.35s ease-out; }
    @keyframes pop { from { transform: scale(0.88); } }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .stage :global(*) { transition: none !important; scroll-behavior: auto !important; }
  }
</style>
